d:["$","p","7",{"className":"mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-300","children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Instead of designing an invoice from scratch, you start with a format and fill in the correct information. This is useful because invoices need consistency. If every invoice looks different, it becomes harder to track payments, explain charges and maintain records."}]]}]
